      "html": "<section class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-top:90px\"><div class=\"over\">Swiggy Agent Desk · Deep Dive</div><p class=\"h1\">A decision-support screen for the agent who takes over when the bot steps aside.</p><div class=\"g4\"><div></div><p class=\"lead c3\" style=\"margin-top:22px\">It brings the chat, the order, the evidence, each party's history and the policy into one view, and it never makes the decision for the agent. A self-initiated concept, not affiliated with Swiggy.</p></div><div class=\"g4 info\"><div><div class=\"k\">Discipline</div><div class=\"v\">Enterprise SaaS</div></div><div><div class=\"k\">Role</div><div class=\"v\">Interaction Designer</div></div><div><div class=\"k\">Tools Used</div><div class=\"v\">Figma, FigJam, Claude</div></div><div><div class=\"k\">Timeline</div><div class=\"v\">26 days</div></div></div><img class=\"render\" src=\"/images/covers/projects/swiggy-agent-desk/home.jpg\" alt=\"The Agent Desk screen, a wrong-item ticket mid-chat\"></section>"
